 <section id="voltage" class="mb-16">
 <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
 <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">3. PD 3.1 Voltage Selection: 28V/36V/48V, Which EPR Tier Serves Your Target Market?</h2>
 <div class="overflow-x-auto">
 <table class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-xl">
 <thead class="bg-brandBlue text-white">
 <tr>
 <th class="text-left p-3 font-black uppercase text-xs">Voltage</th>
