 <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">4. E-Marker Cable Sourcing: Specifications, FOB Cost &amp; USB-IF Certification Tiers</h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Your cable matters as much as your charger. Here's what you need at each power level:</p>
